<title>USA: TheraTech appoints Dinesh Patel chairman.</title>
<headline>TheraTech appoints Dinesh Patel chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>TheraTech Inc said Thursday it appointed president and chief executive Dinesh Patel to the additional position of chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Patel succeeds William Higuchi as chairman.  Higuchi will continue as a member of the board of directors.</p>
<p>TheraTech makes pharmaceutical products.</p>
